{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0494_1000_p", "source_sha256": "78b090a585a7f0eeff805ee2a5bc22c06498072b8523cad263c5795928688773", "ja": "（今日は、可憐の新曲の発売を記念した\nトークショーが行われる。さて、可憐の様子は……？）", "zh": "（今天要举行纪念可怜新曲发售的访谈会。话说回来，可怜现在怎么样了……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0494_1001_045kar", "source_sha256": "01f92c5a04998f3c9b45eed4993e5046bbef0ca566dd15561df48372d7081f7b", "ja": "えっと……。うん、何度も確認したし……\n練習もしたから……ぜ、絶対、大丈夫……！", "zh": "那个……嗯，我已经确认过好多遍了……\n也练习过了……绝、绝对没问题……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0494_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e5bd1dbd08ff77b56c21b4ff2ae6a29b5678be00dacbf859172ab80dbf0a3e51", "ja": "お疲れさま、可憐。\nそろそろ時間だけど、用意はいいか？", "zh": "辛苦了，可怜。\n差不多到时间了，准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0494_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "aae81bfee26775a1871893bd9cc9a9a9a64c8dd389d1f92d301f255a2c826645", "ja": "{$P$}さん……も、もちろん、大丈夫\nです！　き、今日のために、準備してきましたから……", "zh": "{$P$}先生……当、当然，没问题！我、我已经为今天准备好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0494_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ef4d38a856aa28a079b7984c10748766089db695f099966e28f9cf6bfc4f6c08", "ja": "それは頼もしいな。\n可憐が頑張った新曲のPVも、いよいよお披露目だ。", "zh": "这真是令人放心啊。\n可怜努力拍摄的新曲PV，也终于要和大家见面了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0494_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "b27506a4e490d6c4baf6535afb3d0fa1f21436e79fb7467a87caa9d831471454", "ja": "は、はい……！\n今までの私とは、違う自分を見せられるように……。", "zh": "是、是的……！\n希望能展现出与以往的我不同的一面……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0494_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "6fea005c58759f4790959249dab990b2b8de837cc4642468e9aee043748c4f6e", "ja": "みんなにしっかり見てもらえるように、\n勇気を出していきたいと、思います……！", "zh": "为了能让大家都好好看清，\n我想拿出勇气来……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0494_1007_p", "source_sha256": "47c8c763104e56e96471585b4a8912d78cf1c596aefb69dcbb0695746590c732", "ja": "うん。こうやって話してる今も、\n可憐のやる気が伝わってくるよ。", "zh": "嗯。就连现在这样聊天的时候，也能感受到可怜的干劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0494_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "d41d032ad37f6a5dfc00eb0db38802daf49a84a3ef06b06197f596d06ac0c1ec", "ja": "え、えへへ。\nそう言ってもらえると、嬉しいです……。", "zh": "诶、嘿嘿。\n你能这么说，我很开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0494_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "5f6a832e05765790a294759d69fc116a04ed8e83edf6fe0f922ccaf687055088", "ja": "きっと、私を応援してくれる人の中にも……\n自分に、自信を持てない人が、いると思うんです。", "zh": "我想，支持我的人当中……\n一定也有对自己没有信心的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0494_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "e39453a8da15944b28d3992d220c1e4914805590fb9af0e7f0057538544d6fa0", "ja": "私がアイドルになって、変えてもらったみたいに……\n少しでも、誰かの背中を押せたらって……！", "zh": "就像我成为偶像之后，被改变了一样……\n哪怕只是一点点，也想推动某个人向前迈步……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0494_1011_p", "source_sha256": "320be27d134863abd171c3c1e4edf337204e610a1762af273b9093689906ee5a", "ja": "……大丈夫。可憐の気持ちは、みんなにも伝わるよ。", "zh": "……没关系的。可怜的心意，一定也能传达给大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0494_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "47a2a8d906029c2416e40687f3ed362e787973d8332cae40a806abc3c13ea9e6", "ja": "えへへ、ありがとうございます……。\n実は……今日、普段と違うアロマを持ってきたんです。", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢您……  \n其实……我今天带来了和平时不一样的香薰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0494_1013_045kar", "source_sha256": "f71dd129320233fbe06467207d7fc778390fc429e8aa4c9d7f8b4f0c7eed0c48", "ja": "来てくれた人たちが、何か挑戦する時……今日のことを\n思い出して、勇気を出してもらえたら、いいなって……", "zh": "希望前来的人们在挑战什么的时候……能想起今天的事，鼓起勇气就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0494_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "031706dd4fba2161b11f370d94f6f4040222160745aa35b3c85e33dbd3b6be3f", "ja": "離れていても、応援してるよって……\n私からの、メッセージです……なんて♪", "zh": "就算相隔两地，我也会为你加油……这是我想传达给大家的话……之类的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
